## 7. The MiiISA — Native Instruction Set

The MiiISA extends the RISC-V RV64 base ISA using the custom functional unit (CFU) mechanism. RISC-V's modular design allows custom instruction encoding via the R-type instruction format with custom opcode spaces, enabling application-specific instructions without breaking compliance with the base specification.

The RISC-V architecture's open nature — with over 10 billion cores shipped and near-parity with ARM performance projected by end of 2026 — makes it the natural control-plane choice. The MiiISA adds the following instructions to the base set:

### 7.1 Adjunction Instructions

| Mnemonic | Operands | Description | Executing Unit | Latency |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| `ADJOIN F G` | rd, rs1, rs2 | Compute adjunction unit η_C: C → G(F(C)) | TTE + LIE | 3 cycles |
| `COUNIT F G` | rd, rs1, rs2 | Compute adjunction counit ε_M: F(G(M)) → M | TTE + Balance | 3 cycles |
| `NATBIJ` | rd, rs1, rs2 | Compute natural bijection Φ_{C,M}: Hom(F(C),M) → Hom(C,G(M)) | TTE | 1 cycle |

### 7.2 Functor Instructions

| Mnemonic | Operands | Description | Executing Unit | Latency |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| `FORMAL C` | rd, rs1 | Execute F-functor: extract patterns from trace of C | LIE + Trace Buffer | ~1.2 µs |
| `GROUND M θ` | rd, rs1, imm | Execute G-functor with threshold θ; filter TTE by w > θ | TTE (TCAM search) | ~0.3 µs |
| `LIFT S` | rd, rs1 | Execute P-functor: interpret vertices as propositions | H-CAM + TTE | ~0.4 µs |
| `QUOT M` | rd, rs1 | Execute Q-functor: encode propositions into crossbar | ReRAM crossbar | ~0.8 µs |
| `REFLECT M` | rd, rs1 | Execute R-endofunctor: increase γ, refine TTE | Balance + TTE | ~0.5 µs |

### 7.3 Fixed-Point and Convergence Instructions

| Mnemonic | Operands | Description | Executing Unit | Latency |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| `ITERATE T ε` | rd, rs1, imm | Run Kleene chain until convergence within ε | FPC + Y-Seq | ~3.5 µs/iter |
| `GLUE {Uᵢ}` | rd, rs1, imm | Sheaf patch across covering family of size imm | Sheaf Coprocessor | <10 µs |
| `BALANCE α β γ` | imm3 | Write balance coefficients to Balance Register | Balance Arbiter | 1 cycle |
| `MERGE M1 M2` | rd, rs1, rs2 | Execute ⊕ meta-state merge | Sheaf Coprocessor | ~0.6 µs |
| `JACCARD` | rd, rs1, rs2 | Compute coh(f,g) = \|A∩B\|/\|A∪B\| | Jaccard Engine | 1 cycle |

### 7.4 Safety Instructions

| Mnemonic | Description | Hardware Enforced |
|---|---|---|
| `CONSIST C` | Assert logical consistency of proposition set | LIE write-verify |
| `WCHECK w` | Assert coupling weight w > 0.5 before TTE write | TTE comparator |
| `NORM` | Assert and restore α + β + γ = 1 | Balance Arbiter |

